author":{"date":"2026-09-12T18:32:32Z","email":"ds.sefina@gmail.com","name":"Sefina-DS"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-12T18:32:32Z","email":"ds.sefina@gmail.com","name":"Sefina-DS"},"message":"fix: coerce map.timestamp_ms/moptype/l2r to number before getType/setState (Fixes #141)\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01QYfrtd9APeCHT5jBK49oM6","tree":{"sha":"175453dab0395411b523b8ed9ce893fa913e2e7e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/git/trees/175453dab0395411b523b8ed9ce893fa913e2e7e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/git/commits/546ea34f0a3b4524fad51744020eb58f43bd7c3a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/commit/546ea34f0a3b4524fad51744020eb58f43bd7c3a","node_id":"C_kwDOMGdLNtoAKDU0NmVhMzRmMGEzYjQ1MjRmYWQ1MTc0NDAyMGViNThmNDNiZDdjM2E","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/commit/2785fe7817109a88cdf27040f4e7e630ea9067b8","sha":"2785fe7817109a88cdf27040f4e7e630ea9067b8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/commits/2785fe7817109a88cdf27040f4e7e630ea9067b8"}],"sha":"546ea34f0a3b4524fad51744020eb58f43bd7c3a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/commits/546ea34f0a3b4524fad51744020eb58f43bd7c3a"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/commits/7e137abdb9a83fa677a9340a856de148d23d0b86/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-12T18:04:11Z","email":"ds.sefina@gmail.com","name":"Sefina-DS"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-12T18:04:11Z","email":"ds.sefina@gmail.com","name":"Sefina-DS"},"message":"fix: robuster Fehlerpfad bei Kartenabruf/-diagnose (Issue #138)\n\nZwei unabhaengige Robustheits-Fixes, keine Aenderung am Normalverhalten:\n\n- main.js getMap(): wenn die Kartendatei-Abfrage fehlschlaegt, blieb\n  mapsContent undefined und der folgende Zugriff auf mapsContent.data\n  warf einen unbehandelten TypeError, der nur als generisches\n  \"Error fetching map data\" im aeusseren catch sichtbar wurde. Jetzt\n  early-return mit aussagekraeftigem log.debug.\n\n- lib/mapController.js: fehlt fuer ein Modell der AES-IV-Eintrag in\n  MODEL_IV_TABLE (dreame.js), wird die Basiskarte grundsaetzlich nie\n  ladbar sein - kein reines Timing-Problem beim Adapterstart. Ein\n  persistenter Merker (this.unsupportedMapModel) sorgt dafuer, dass\n  _kartenPaketEmpfangen in diesem Fall eine passende Meldung statt des\n  generischen \"Adapter neu starten\"-Hinweises ausgibt.\n\nLive getestet auf Gina (r9419h, did 2123610128): regulaeres\nKartenverhalten unveraendert, keine neuen Logs/Fehler.\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01QYfrtd9APeCHT5jBK49oM6","tree":{"sha":"71b40e94b65e9c3a80fdfb43b50c1b554f0303b3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/git/trees/71b40e94b65e9c3a80fdfb43b50c1b554f0303b3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/git/commits/7e137abdb9a83fa677a9340a856de148d23d0b86","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/commit/7e137abdb9a83fa677a9340a856de148d23d0b86","node_id":"C_kwDOMGdLNtoAKDdlMTM3YWJkYjlhODNmYTY3N2E5MzQwYTg1NmRlMTQ4ZDIzZDBiODY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/commit/2785fe7817109a88cdf27040f4e7e630ea9067b8","sha":"2785fe7817109a88cdf27040f4e7e630ea9067b8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/commits/2785fe7817109a88cdf27040f4e7e630ea9067b8"}],"sha":"7e137abdb9a83fa677a9340a856de148d23d0b86","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/commits/7e137abdb9a83fa677a9340a856de148d23d0b86"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/commits/2785fe7817109a88cdf27040f4e7e630ea9067b8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-12T17:35:27Z","email":"ds.sefina@gmail.com","name":"Sefina-DS"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-12T17:35:27Z","email":"ds.sefina@gmail.com","name":"Sefina-DS"},"message":"ci: add Node.js 26.x to adapter test matrix (#137)\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01SnxicPFxM63ZgwmxDryDwK","tree":{"sha":"134c2898347c7fa401671db6f282d359b267babc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/git/trees/134c2898347c7fa401671db6f282d359b267babc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/git/commits/2785fe7817109a88cdf27040f4e7e630ea9067b8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/commit/2785fe7817109a88cdf27040f4e7e630ea9067b8","node_id":"C_kwDOMGdLNtoAKDI3ODVmZTc4MTcxMDlhODhjZGYyNzA0MGY0ZTdlNjMwZWE5MDY3Yjg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/commit/a3330d2ea9a3160065f225541b771ea46e571214","sha":"a3330d2ea9a3160065f225541b771ea46e571214","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/commits/a3330d2ea9a3160065f225541b771ea46e571214"}],"sha":"2785fe7817109a88cdf27040f4e7e630ea9067b8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/commits/2785fe7817109a88cdf27040f4e7e630ea9067b8"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/commits/a3330d2ea9a3160065f225541b771ea46e571214/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-12T04:17:43Z","email":"ds.sefina@gmail.com","name":"Sefina-DS"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-12T16:47:48Z","email":"ds.sefina@gmail.com","name":"Sefina-DS"},"message":"release: v0.4.8 - Fix Issue #119 for Dreame L40s / X40 Ultra (r9419*): SIID 4 PIID 6 is remapped to reflect mop-pad presence 1:1, same as r6001a in v0.4.7, based on an isolated pad-remove/reinstall test on an r9419h device in this development cycle. Generalize the mop-in-station / mop-pad-installed fixes from v0.4.7 across all vacuum models: the permanently-0 mop-in-station property is now removed from every vacuum device''s object tree at spec load time, and mop-pad-installed is renamed to mop-handling-pulse since it only emits ~1s pulses during mechanical mop handling (state id unchanged so existing user scripts keep working). The frischwasser widget''s Mopp-montiert indicator now uses the mop-pad-presence state on models where the REMAP is active — visible after the first cloud poll cycle following the update. Also completes missing UI translations (Issue #122). Thanks to @SilentM1978 and @ralfheitz for confirming the pulse behavior on their devices.","tree":{"sha":"37e60fef6825f304babda1cc5acf7f79e741612d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/git/trees/37e60fef6825f304babda1cc5acf7f79e741612d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/git/commits/a3330d2ea9a3160065f225541b771ea46e571214","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/commit/a3330d2ea9a3160065f225541b771ea46e571214","node_id":"C_kwDOMGdLNtoAKGEzMzMwZDJlYTlhMzE2MDA2NWYyMjU1NDFiNzcxZWE0NmU1NzEyMTQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/commit/8abbca44684b7bd4eb4071a69221b3fd072f3f3c","sha":"8abbca44684b7bd4eb4071a69221b3fd072f3f3c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/commits/8abbca44684b7bd4eb4071a69221b3fd072f3f3c"}],"sha":"a3330d2ea9a3160065f225541b771ea46e571214","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/commits/a3330d2ea9a3160065f225541b771ea46e571214"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/commits/8abbca44684b7bd4eb4071a69221b3fd072f3f3c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-11T17:03:09Z","email":"ds.sefina@gmail.com","name":"Sefina-DS"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-12T16:47:48Z","email":"ds.sefina@gmail.com","name":"Sefina-DS"},"message":"fix(widget/frischwasser): drive mop-mounted display from water-tank on models with REMAP\n\nOn r6001* (v0.4.7) and r9419* (this release), SIID 4/PIID 6 is remapped\nto reflect mop-pad presence 1:1. The frischwasser widget was still\nreading SIID 4/PIID 53 (mop-pad-installed) as the source of the\n\"Mopp montiert\" indicator — that property emits ~1s pulses only, so the\nwidget showed \"not mounted\" almost all the time even when pads were on.\n\nThe widget now:\n- Subscribes to both status.water-tank (moppStatusPersist) and\n  status.mop-pad-installed (moppStatusPuls).\n- Detects at load time whether SIID 4/PIID 6 has the REMAP''d 2-value\n  states map ({0,1}) or the generic 3-value one ({0,1,10}) by reading\n  common.states via the existing getObject/common.states pipeline.\n- Uses moppStatusPersist as the display source on models where the\n  REMAP is active (r6001*, r9419*), and falls back to moppStatusPuls\n  elsewhere. The fallback is the pre-0.4.8 behavior, so nothing gets\n  worse on models where the REMAP has not been enabled.\n- Removes the pre-#119 \"diagnostic parallel display\" of mop-in-station\n  and the paired justification comment. Both are obsolete now that\n  mop-in-station is removed at spec load time.\n\nUser-visible effect appears on the first cloud poll cycle after the\nupdate: existing state objects retain their old common.name/states\nuntil the adapter''s next _lazyCreateState pass for that property.\n\nRefs #119.\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_013X7V99pog8nmL3yDzZLCvf","tree":{"sha":"0a51eca632d9a8b328a0b46fcfce48c3815fb59f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/git/trees/0a51eca632d9a8b328a0b46fcfce48c3815fb59f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/git/commits/8abbca44684b7bd4eb4071a69221b3fd072f3f3c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/commit/8abbca44684b7bd4eb4071a69221b3fd072f3f3c","node_id":"C_kwDOMGdLNtoAKDhhYmJjYTQ0Njg0YjdiZDRlYjQwNzFhNjkyMjFiM2ZkMDcyZjNmM2M","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/commit/6b6ca88adb47406a10fa7d700d6496152c270324","sha":"6b6ca88adb47406a10fa7d700d6496152c270324","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/commits/6b6ca88adb47406a10fa7d700d6496152c270324"}],"sha":"8abbca44684b7bd4eb4071a69221b3fd072f3f3c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/commits/8abbca44684b7bd4eb4071a69221b3fd072f3f3c"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/commits/6b6ca88adb47406a10fa7d700d6496152c270324/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-11T17:02:58Z","email":"ds.sefina@gmail.com","name":"Sefina-DS"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-12T16:47:48Z","email":"ds.sefina@gmail.com","name":"Sefina-DS"},"message":"feat(model-overrides): generalize dead/pulse mop-states across all vacuum models\n\n- REMOVE SIID 4/PIID 52 (mop-in-station) via new ''all-vacuum'' override\n  family. Property is permanently 0 on r6001*, r9419*, r2253* and never\n  updates on any vacuum family observed so far, so it is now removed\n  from every vacuum device''s object tree at spec load time.\n- RENAME SIID 4/PIID 53 (mop-pad-installed) to mop-handling-pulse via\n  nameKey directly in lib/specs/cleaning.js. Property emits ~1s pulses\n  during mechanical mop handling only, not a persistent state. The\n  state id is unchanged so existing user scripts on the old path keep\n  working.\n- Add r9419* (Dreame L40s / X40 Ultra) to the model-override roster with\n  the same REMAP for SIID 4/PIID 6 that was introduced for r6001a in\n  v0.4.7. Isolated pad-remove/reinstall test on Gina''s r9419h in this\n  session confirmed PIID 6 tracks mop-pad presence 1:1 on this family\n  as well.\n- Extend the override dispatcher to always apply ''all-vacuum'' overrides\n  before family-specific ones, so devices without a family match still\n  benefit from generic fixes.\n- Rename the migration method from _cleanupR6001MopInStation to the\n  generic _cleanupDeadMopInStation and run it for every vacuum device\n  (per-device marker info.mopInStationCleanupV1 unchanged so users who\n  migrated on 0.4.7 for r6001a don''t get double-migrated).\n\nr2253* (Dreame L20 Ultra) intentionally not included in the REMAP: PIID 6\nsemantics on that family not yet verified in isolated testing.\n\nRefs #119.\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_013X7V99pog8nmL3yDzZLCvf","tree":{"sha":"ba0b6634731b5beaa0cb7b8c3d9b629a5d10300f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/git/trees/ba0b6634731b5beaa0cb7b8c3d9b629a5d10300f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/git/commits/6b6ca88adb47406a10fa7d700d6496152c270324","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/commit/6b6ca88adb47406a10fa7d700d6496152c270324","node_id":"C_kwDOMGdLNtoAKDZiNmNhODhhZGI0NzQwNmExMGZhN2Q3MDBkNjQ5NjE1MmMyNzAzMjQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/commit/d094fba27497576a8ac84b12f8b6c09bd39f13df","sha":"d094fba27497576a8ac84b12f8b6c09bd39f13df","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/commits/d094fba27497576a8ac84b12f8b6c09bd39f13df"}],"sha":"6b6ca88adb47406a10fa7d700d6496152c270324","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/commits/6b6ca88adb47406a10fa7d700d6496152c270324"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/commits/d094fba27497576a8ac84b12f8b6c09bd39f13df/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-06T14:19:52Z","email":"ds.sefina@gmail.com","name":"Sefina-DS"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-12T16:47:48Z","email":"ds.sefina@gmail.com","name":"Sefina-DS"},"message":"fix: add missing help i18n translations f