6395e338264a562179f9","sha":"52b2718252e4e520c2276395e338264a562179f9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/commits/52b2718252e4e520c2276395e338264a562179f9"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/commit/b24d14e58d12d2c2a5a49a5d6276c11e9674fbed","sha":"b24d14e58d12d2c2a5a49a5d6276c11e9674fbed","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/commits/b24d14e58d12d2c2a5a49a5d6276c11e9674fbed"}],"sha":"a49e5c9dfb4ab299cbe39d752613ff34aa36c332","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/commits/a49e5c9dfb4ab299cbe39d752613ff34aa36c332"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/commits/52b2718252e4e520c2276395e338264a562179f9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-04T15:45:04Z","email":"ds.sefina@gmail.com","name":"Sefina-DS"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-04T15:45:04Z","email":"ds.sefina@gmail.com","name":"Sefina-DS"},"message":"fix(specs): deriveStates-Feld in buildVacuumLookup-Whitelist ergaenzen (Issue #126)\n\nCommit 49fc6f9 fuehrte das Feld deriveStates am clean-water-tank-status-\nSpec-Eintrag ein, um daraus abgeleitete Bool-States (installed/low) zu\nerzeugen. buildVacuumLookup() in lib/specs/index.js baut metaMap[key]\njedoch ueber eine explizite Feld-Whitelist, die deriveStates nicht\nenthielt - das Feld ging beim Aufbau der metaMap fuer JEDES Geraet\nverloren, nicht nur modellspezifisch. Die Ausfuehrungslogik in\nmain.js:_lazyCreateState war korrekt, wurde aber nie erreicht.\n\nLive auf Gina (X40 Ultra, r9419h) verifiziert: vor dem Fix fehlten\nclean-water-tank-installed und clean-water-tank-low komplett als\nStates (kein Fehler im Log, stiller Ausfall).\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01BgXTGQbTEKrBw5nj5a37zS","tree":{"sha":"a6963be95c32dfcfb18d3dad1c6e2ab2af3a87d5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/git/trees/a6963be95c32dfcfb18d3dad1c6e2ab2af3a87d5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/git/commits/52b2718252e4e520c2276395e338264a562179f9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/commit/52b2718252e4e520c2276395e338264a562179f9","node_id":"C_kwDOMGdLNtoAKDUyYjI3MTgyNTJlNGU1MjBjMjI3NjM5NWUzMzgyNjRhNTYyMTc5Zjk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/commit/df9a77ef284060f361cb93c0ea1186fa67f22f6e","sha":"df9a77ef284060f361cb93c0ea1186fa67f22f6e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/commits/df9a77ef284060f361cb93c0ea1186fa67f22f6e"}],"sha":"52b2718252e4e520c2276395e338264a562179f9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/commits/52b2718252e4e520c2276395e338264a562179f9"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/commits/b24d14e58d12d2c2a5a49a5d6276c11e9674fbed/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-04T08:35:35Z","email":"ds.sefina@gmail.com","name":"Sefina-DS"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-04T08:35:35Z","email":"ds.sefina@gmail.com","name":"Sefina-DS"},"message":"feat(widget/frischwasser): Reinigungsmittel-Anzeige fuer L20-Ultra-Modelle (Issue #126)\n\nNeue Zeile im \"Wasser & Mopp\"-Panel: Reinigungsmittel-Restbestand in Prozent,\noptional mit Restzeit in Stunden (Format \"42 % (~23 h uebrig)\", analog zu\nwasch-zyklen). Bindet die zwei neuen Adapter-States detergent-left (SIID 20/1,\n%) und detergent-time-left (SIID 20/2, h) aus Commit df9a77e.\n\nNur relevant auf Modellen, die SIID 20 senden (r2253*/L20 Ultra). Auf X40\nbleiben die States null; die Zeile wird nicht gerendert.\n\nUeber die versteckbareFelder-Konvention ausblendbar.\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_0164QjH3kTj5DAmXVCYg3rkK","tree":{"sha":"d8c6af70189c6cd3efdde06bf00995d826f664b8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/git/trees/d8c6af70189c6cd3efdde06bf00995d826f664b8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/git/commits/b24d14e58d12d2c2a5a49a5d6276c11e9674fbed","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/commit/b24d14e58d12d2c2a5a49a5d6276c11e9674fbed","node_id":"C_kwDOMGdLNtoAKGIyNGQxNGU1OGQxMmQyYzJhNWE0OWE1ZDYyNzZjMTFlOTY3NGZiZWQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/commit/99ab6eccf41c672291c93c25888cc7b9fb101ac5","sha":"99ab6eccf41c672291c93c25888cc7b9fb101ac5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/commits/99ab6eccf41c672291c93c25888cc7b9fb101ac5"}],"sha":"b24d14e58d12d2c2a5a49a5d6276c11e9674fbed","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/commits/b24d14e58d12d2c2a5a49a5d6276c11e9674fbed"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/commits/99ab6eccf41c672291c93c25888cc7b9fb101ac5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-04T08:31:01Z","email":"ds.sefina@gmail.com","name":"Sefina-DS"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-04T08:31:01Z","email":"ds.sefina@gmail.com","name":"Sefina-DS"},"message":"fix(widget/frischwasser): Tank-Status auf abgeleitete Bool-States umstellen (Issue #126)\n\nErsetzt die numerische Enum-Interpretation (clean-water-tank-status als\n0/2 = \"eingesetzt\", sonst \"draussen\") durch die modellunabhaengigen\nBool-States clean-water-tank-installed und clean-water-tank-low, die der\nAdapter seit Commit 49fc6f9 mitschreibt.\n\nFix des Screenshot-Bugs: L20-Ultra-Modelle (r2253*) sendeten Rohwert 3\n(installiert+voll) — die alte Enum-Logik interpretierte das als \"draussen\",\nobwohl der Tank drin und voll war.\n\nBonus: Widget zeigt jetzt drei Zustaende statt zwei — \"eingesetzt\",\n\"eingesetzt, Wasser niedrig\" und \"draussen\". Neuer i18n-Key\ntank-status.eingesetzt-niedrig in de.json und en.json.\n\nDie Enum-Kenntnis lebt nur noch im Adapter; das Widget kennt keine\nnumerischen SIID-27/1-Semantik-Details mehr.\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_0164QjH3kTj5DAmXVCYg3rkK","tree":{"sha":"154efddcae6a8010c4b298c93799c72bdcd57fad","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/git/trees/154efddcae6a8010c4b298c93799c72bdcd57fad"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/git/commits/99ab6eccf41c672291c93c25888cc7b9fb101ac5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/commit/99ab6eccf41c672291c93c25888cc7b9fb101ac5","node_id":"C_kwDOMGdLNtoAKDk5YWI2ZWNjZjQxYzY3MjI5MWM5M2MyNTg4OGNjN2I5ZmIxMDFhYzU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/commit/4a8dac7827247e8f2ceef9d8c52b99a0007e9452","sha":"4a8dac7827247e8f2ceef9d8c52b99a0007e9452","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/commits/4a8dac7827247e8f2ceef9d8c52b99a0007e9452"}],"sha":"99ab6eccf41c672291c93c25888cc7b9fb101ac5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/commits/99ab6eccf41c672291c93c25888cc7b9fb101ac5"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/commits/4a8dac7827247e8f2ceef9d8c52b99a0007e9452/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-04T08:27:00Z","email":"ds.sefina@gmail.com","name":"Sefina-DS"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-04T08:27:00Z","email":"ds.sefina@gmail.com","name":"Sefina-DS"},"message":"fix(widget): .warnbox mit hidden-Attribut ausblenden (Issue #126)\n\nDie Regel .warnbox { display: flex; ... } setzt die Anzeige unbedingt und\nschlaegt per Cascade-Origin das UA-Default [hidden]{display:none}. Ergebnis:\nein Container, der ueber JS auf hidden=true gesetzt wurde, blieb als leere,\naber sichtbare Box mit orangem Border stehen.\n\nSichtbar im \"Wasser & Mopp\"-Panel bei fehlender Warnmeldung; latent auch im\nFehler-Panel bei 0 Fehlern (fehler.js:193 nutzt dasselbe hidden-Muster).\n\nFix: .warnbox[hidden]{display:none}, analog zur bereits etablierten\nKonvention bei #zahnradBtn[hidden] (layout.css:163) und .rkarte[hidden]\n(layout.css:581).\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_0164QjH3kTj5DAmXVCYg3rkK","tree":{"sha":"7c8900327c67719701adb5de4999183d67a069b6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/git/trees/7c8900327c67719701adb5de4999183d67a069b6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/git/commits/4a8dac7827247e8f2ceef9d8c52b99a0007e9452","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/commit/4a8dac7827247e8f2ceef9d8c52b99a0007e9452","node_id":"C_kwDOMGdLNtoAKDRhOGRhYzc4MjcyNDdlOGYyY2VlZjlkOGM1MmI5OWEwMDA3ZTk0NTI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/commit/69043f9905b059b1e7025a7d74e20e5ac14a130c","sha":"69043f9905b059b1e7025a7d74e20e5ac14a130c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/commits/69043f9905b059b1e7025a7d74e20e5ac14a130c"}],"sha":"4a8dac7827247e8f2ceef9d8c52b99a0007e9452","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/commits/4a8dac7827247e8f2ceef9d8c52b99a0007e9452"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/commits/df9a77ef284060f361cb93c0ea1186fa67f22f6e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-04T08:17:11Z","email":"ds.sefina@gmail.com","name":"Sefina-DS"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-04T08:17:11Z","email":"ds.sefina@gmail.com","name":"Sefina-DS"},"message":"feat(consumables): SIID 20 Detergent-States detergent-left/-time-left\n\nAuf L20 Ultra (r2253*) sitzt der Reinigungsmittel-Status auf SIID 20/1 (Rest\nin %) und 20/2 (Restzeit in h), nicht auf SIID 27/4 wie bei der X40-Reihe.\nDer Adapter kannte die Zuordnung bislang nur in der internen Fallback-Map\n(PROPERTY_NAME_MAP), legte aber keine expliziten States dafuer an — die\nWerte waren fuer L20-User nur unter dem generischen Pfad status.20-1\nsichtbar.\n\nFix: zwei neue explizite States im gleichen Stil wie SIID 16 (Sensor) und\nSIID 18 (Mop Pad). Der bestehende status.detergent-status (SIID 27/4)\nbleibt fuer X40-Modelle unangetastet.\n\nBestaetigt durch Reporter in TA2k/ioBroker.dreame#126: luckyheiko und\nralfheitz sehen den korrekten Reinigungsmittel-Wert unter status.20-1.\n\ni18n: Neue Keys in allen 11 Sprachen manuell ergaenzt (siehe Erfahrung\naus Commit 49fc6f9 mit npm run translate).\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_0164QjH3kTj5DAmXVCYg3rkK","tree":{"sha":"02d76b23be3ca78066ce65fb39b8f8fe15ccfd82","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/git/trees/02d76b23be3ca78066ce65fb39b8f8fe15ccfd82"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/git/commits/df9a77ef284060f361cb93c0ea1186fa67f22f6e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/commit/df9a77ef284060f361cb93c0ea1186fa67f22f6e","node_id":"C_kwDOMGdLNtoAKGRmOWE3N2VmMjg0MDYwZjM2MWNiOTNjMGVhMTE4NmZhNjdmMjJmNmU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/commit/49fc6f99ebb159038239795d4898af608b51b08f","sha":"49fc6f99ebb159038239795d4898af608b51b08f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/commits/49fc6f99ebb159038239795d4898af608b51b08f"}],"sha":"df9a77ef284060f361cb93c0ea1186fa67f22f6e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/commits/df9a77ef284060f361cb93c0ea1186fa67f22f6e"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/commits/49fc6f99ebb159038239795d4898af608b51b08f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-04T06:10:23Z","email":"ds.sefina@gmail.com","name":"Sefina-DS"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-04T06:10:23Z","email":"ds.sefina@gmail.com","name":"Sefina-DS"},"message":"feat(station): abgeleitete Bool-States clean-water-tank-installed/-low\n\nDamit Widgets und andere Consumer nicht mit numerischer Enum-Interpretation\numgehen muessen, werden zwei abgeleitete Boolean-States eingefuehrt:\n- clean-water-tank-installed (installed = !nicht-installiert)\n- clean-water-tank-low       (low = installed && niedriger Wasserstand)\n\nBeide werden aus dem normalisierten clean-water-tank-status abgeleitet (nach\nCommit b19f861), sind also modellunabhaengig konsistent.\n\nDer Mechanismus (Feld deriveStates am spec-Eintrag, generischer Loop in\n_lazyCreateState) ist wiederverwendbar fuer weitere abgeleitete States, die\nin Zukunft benoetigt werden.\n\ni18n: Neue Keys in allen 11 Sprachen manuell ergaenzt (npm run translate\nlieferte bei diesem Lauf Rate-Limit-Fehler fuer 8 Sprachen und\nRetranslation-Churn fuer die zwei erfolgreichen — fuer zwei kurze Strings\nwar die Handuebersetzung sauberer).\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_0164QjH3kTj5DAmXVCYg3rkK","tree":{"sha":"a27744a077d7ef213299843765055f6f92790987","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/git/trees/a27744a077d7ef213299843765055f6f92790987"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/git/commits/49fc6f99ebb159038239795d4898af608b51b08f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/commit/49fc6f99ebb159038239795d4898af608b51b08f","node_id":"C_kwDOMGdLNtoAKDQ5ZmM2Zjk5ZWJiMTU5MDM4MjM5Nzk1ZDQ4OThhZjYwOGI1MWIwOGY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/commit/b19f8613826d8585deb66c21a7c51e385ca2a3b2","sha":"b19f8613826d8585deb66c21a7c51e385ca2a3b2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/commits/b19f8613826d8585deb66c21a7c51e385ca2a3b2"}],"sha":"49fc6f99ebb159038239795d4898af608b51b08f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/commits/49fc6f99ebb159038239795d4898af608b51b08f"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/commits/b19f8613826d8585deb66c21a7c51e385ca2a3b2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-04T05:37:37Z","email":"ds.sefina@gmail.com","name":"Sefina-DS"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-04T05:37:37Z","email":"ds.sefina@gmail.com","name":"Sefina-DS"},"message":"fix(station): SIID 27/1 clean-water-tank-status fuer r2253-Modelle normalisieren\n\nL20 Ultra (r2253c/r2253w) sendet SIID 27/1 als Bit-Maske (Bit 1 = installiert,\nBit 0 = voll), nicht als Enum wie die X40-Reihe. Ohne Normalisierung waren die\nEnum-Labels invertiert (Rohwert 3 wurde als \"Not installed\" angezeigt, obwohl\nTank installiert und voll ist).\n\nFix: r2253*-Rohwerte werden auf die X40-Enum-Semantik abgebildet (0=Installed,\n1=Not installed, 2=Low water). Modell-Erkennung ueber Praefix .startsWith(\n''dreame.vacuum.r2253''), Stil analog lib/dreame.js. Alle anderen Modelle bleiben\nunveraendert.\n\nAls Nebeneffekt profitiert die Tank-Auto-Reset-Logik (main.js:6308-6348), die\nden Rohwert direkt konsumiert, automatisch von der Normalisierung.\n\nRohwert 1 auf r2253 (theoretisch \"voll aber draussen\", Uebergangs- oder\nFehlerzustand) wird wie Rohwert 0 als \"Not installed\" behandelt. Zusaetzlich\nwird bei diesem Rohwert einmalig ein Debug-Log abgesetzt, falls das Symptom\njemals real auftritt.\n\nBestaetigt durch Reporter in TA2k/ioBroker.dreame#126:\n  luckyheiko (r2253c) und ralfheitz (r2253w).\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_0164QjH3kTj5DAmXVCYg3rkK","tree":{"sha":"0e0f3f322fc7ef26639edc18a77565a70dae3381","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/git/trees/0e0f3f322fc7ef26639edc18a77565a70dae3381"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/git/commits/b19f8613826d8585deb66c21a7c51e385ca2a3b2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/commit/b19f8613826d8585deb66c21a7c51e385ca2a3b2","node_id":"C_kwDOMGdLNtoAKGIxOWY4NjEzODI2ZDg1ODVkZWI2NmMyMWE3YzUxZTM4NWNhMmEzYjI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/commit/afc5e1fe1171fe528529ca954e788204cd4e4c20","sha":"afc5e1fe1171fe528529ca954e788204cd4e4c20","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/commits/afc5e1fe1171fe528529ca954e788204cd4e4c20"}],"sha":"b19f8613826d8585deb66c21a7c51e385ca2a3b2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/commits/b19f8613826d8585deb66c21a7c51e385ca2a3b2"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/commits/afc5e1fe1171fe528529ca954e788204cd4e4c20/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-04T05:32:01Z","email":"ds.sefina@gmail.com","name":"Sefina-DS"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-04T05:32:01Z","email":"ds.sefina@gmail.com","name":"Sefina-DS"},"message":"refactor(specs): Geraeteobjekt als dritten Parameter an decode() durchreichen\n\nBereitet den r2253-clean-water-tank-status-Fix (Issue #126) vor. Bestehende\nDecoder ignorieren den zusaetzlichen Parameter folgenlos.\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_0164QjH3kTj5DAmXVCYg3rkK","tree":{"sha":"8d3d014f1e621cd41d839e50082dee63f78f1e38","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/git/trees/8d3d014f1e621cd41d839e50082dee63f78f1e38"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/git/commits/afc5e1fe1171fe528529ca954e788204cd4e4c20","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/commit/afc5e1fe1171fe528529ca954e788204cd4e4c20","node_id":"C_kwDOMGdLNtoAKGFmYzVlMWZlMTE3MWZlNTI4NTI5Y2E5NTRlNzg4MjA0Y2Q0ZTRjMjA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/commit/554a2218e5a7ef81ed5b6c1dfd9684d19a5950d1","sha":"554a2218e5a7ef81ed5b6c1dfd9684d19a5950d1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/commits/554a2218e5a7ef81ed5b6c1dfd9684d19a5950d1"}],"sha":"afc5e1fe1171fe528529ca954e788204cd4e4c20","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/commits/afc5e1fe1171fe528529ca954e788204cd4e4c20"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/commits/69043f9905b059b1e7025a7d74e20e5ac14a130c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-03T19:50:33Z","email":"ds.sefina@gmail.com","name":"Sefina-DS"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-03T19:50:33Z","email":"ds.sefina@gmail.com","name":"Sefina-DS"},"message":"feat(F10a): order rooms via selects array, not cleanOrder MIoT\n\nReplaces the fragile cleanOrder + start-custom-clean approach with\na deterministic solution: the adapter''s _buildCustomRoomCleaningSelects\nnow sorts the selects array according to remote.cleaning-sequence.order\nbefore sending. The device honors the order in the selects payload,\nwhich arrives atomically with the start command — no race, no timing\ndependency.\n\nChanges:\n- _buildCustomRoomCleaningSelects: reads cleaning-sequence.order at\n  the end, reorders selects if the sequence matches the current\n  selection exactly. Falls back to natural iteration order otherwise\n  (empty sequence, mismatched IDs).\n- UpdateCleaningSequence: no longer sends cleanOrder MIoT action.\n  The .apply handler still validates and sets .active=true,\n  .apply=false, but the ordering is now applied via the selects\n  path on the next .start=true trigger.\n- Removed the _cseqApplyInFlight lock in both UpdateCleaningSequence\n  and Part C. It was defensive coverage for a race that no longer\n  exists.\n- Kept the empty-params guard in the generic send fallback (still\n  needed for the widget''s .remote.cleaning-sequence.order writes on\n  every map tap — no MIoT payload, must not trigger a send).\n\nVerified:\n- Test A: state-set corridor+kitchen, order=[9,4], .start=true.\n  Log shows selects=[[9,...],[4,...]]. Gina cleans corridor first.\n- Test B: same states, order=[4,9]. selects=[[4,...],[9,...]].\n  Gina cleans kitchen first.\n- Test C: widget click, tap corridor then kitchen, start.\n  selects=[[9,...],[4,...]]. Gina cleans corridor first.\n\nAll three paths produce the same deterministic outcome regardless\nof timing between the state writes — meets the requirement that\nboth widget clicks and script/automation with millisecond-tight\nstate writes must work reliably.\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01QE9VKAxHKM5b14qx6UM29B","tree":{"sha":"eac15a0fc6d1d8f7a57f2e9abf6385e035e87bf9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/git/trees/eac15a0fc6d1d8f7a57f2e9abf6385e035e87bf9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/git/commits/69043f9905b059b1e7025a7d74e20e5ac14a130c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/commit/69043f9905b059b1e7025a7d74e20e5ac14a130c","node_id":"C_kwDOMGdLNtoAKDY5MDQzZjk5MDViMDU5YjFlNzAyNWE3ZDc0ZTIwZTVhYzE0YTEzMGM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/commit/00e5cc127f03431a2ce81e4a3cd0160b31c08989","sha":"00e5cc127f03431a2ce81e4a3cd0160b31c08989","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/commits/00e5cc127f03431a2ce81e4a3cd0160b31c08989"}],"sha":"69043f9905b059b1e7025a7d74e20e5ac14a130c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/commits/69043f9905b059b1e7025a7d74e20e5ac14a130c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/15368?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/githu