 0.16.8.\n- [Release notes](https://github.com/humanwhocodes/humanfs/releases)\n- [Changelog](https://github.com/humanwhocodes/humanfs/blob/main/packages/node/CHANGELOG.md)\n- [Commits](https://github.com/humanwhocodes/humanfs/commits/node-v0.16.8/packages/node)\n\n---\nupdated-dependencies:\n- dependency-name: \"@humanfs/node\"\n  dependency-version: 0.16.8\n  dependency-type: indirect\n...\n\nSigned-off-by: dependabot[bot] <support@github.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqmJiRCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAWV0QAIxZfoeoEPbhTjVbuPJrZV53\nI88WSRi5ckV6BtFG+oYwX7g58nFSzDVmrxkZE+y0R7HDe8bBO06xTf5B0aCT27vw\niiaf8HFVdG/y3o6zV/vOJJwqMhjDZlvw2LuzAQ2WMByh+7OEwWE2RcgrvZBzLo1O\n2e7R2ivfqBkKA6uTnkPO4eK7X8TRTNQFoVmvANDaLvX1fMt1diEonTJx/470SrxS\nDi0r+Xy0AN1smx0ib7YwJk+hooNz5dilJkbt+8B4og6d7RccXIGg6JE6qH3iA2RT\nG1kJ01g+tx924NPC2OYgoh1OoA5yfiJj3hzxmEJ9hTMfGczGU66+wbRb5ZY9kuTB\ns0eh1c9Lk6OLFXjxjddmTdBdKCWIaGtU7XqWqEbMfzAWLn/HefFOc7eiRxlR2rnK\nCeAfgKkdLjlBtVD2xqPC3eVc6DF32osNL83aKvg3axxjHAXnR2r7RYBIySSrLY0t\n6HFoFtWMd4gm+GFkAuTnh6wu0LC38blBB0mKE2FROHoN/FdTgYOfWEB0Xxhz2V6v\n5kTOinsx9S55fVkaXEjm7mN5V/R7Q1HCvF6eu25qYMnY7acymaka6KyYqxZ9p0gp\noQIEPCdYCIbjH41/T2cVaYjQ+ux0D7c4ljj3gSbr5g9RhzxRN2N5XIYPLrJo4xNZ\nxv9FivCiKjAsjcewYats\n=5G2z\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-02T21:43:46Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/commit/a4fdcde73ebf0bf0c99a38dce2f1db44b9e4df52","node_id":"C_kwDOMGdLNtoAKGE0ZmRjZGU3M2ViZjBiZjBjOTlhMzhkY2UyZjFkYjQ0YjllNGRmNTI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/commit/13e528de8c862630451be178d0d0cc835ae8ca70","sha":"13e528de8c862630451be178d0d0cc835ae8ca70","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/commits/13e528de8c862630451be178d0d0cc835ae8ca70"}],"sha":"a4fdcde73ebf0bf0c99a38dce2f1db44b9e4df52","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/commits/a4fdcde73ebf0bf0c99a38dce2f1db44b9e4df52"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/commits/00e5cc127f03431a2ce81e4a3cd0160b31c08989/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-02T20:04:44Z","email":"ds.sefina@gmail.com","name":"Sefina-DS"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-02T20:04:44Z","email":"ds.sefina@gmail.com","name":"Sefina-DS"},"message":"fix(widget/F10): reconcile sequence order with room selection on load\n\nWhen the widget reloads while the adapter has a persisted\ncleaning-sequence.order that doesn''t match the current\ncustom-room-cleaning selection, the sequence numbers appeared in\nthe map without any actual room being selected. Start-Cleaning\nwould then take the wrong branch (startCleaning full-map instead\nof startCustomRoomCleaning) and the badges lied about the\nselection state.\n\nFix: sequenceModus.init(did) now reads the current selection from\nthe adapter states (analog reinigung.js: getObjects + getStates\non remote.custom-room-cleaning.map-<mapId>.*, filter by\nnative.roomId + val=true) and reconciles _order against it:\n- IDs in _order that aren''t selected: removed\n- IDs selected but not in _order: appended at the end\n- IDs in both: kept in existing _order sequence\n\nSync writes back to the adapter (Round-trip via _sendOrder) so\nthe persisted state matches the widget UI. Idempotent — if\n_order already matches selection, no write happens.\n\nOnly runs on init/wechsleGeraet, not on every neueDaten-push,\nto avoid loops with in-flight user interactions.\n\nReproduced from a screenshot showing badges 1+2 on kitchen/corridor\nwhile selectedRooms was empty; after this fix, the same simulated\ndivergence resolves to selectedRooms=[]/order=[]/no badges on\nwidget reload, and the adapter state is synced accordingly.\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01PrdcBrhE2SE3Cn2yXtFrhE","tree":{"sha":"76d054117b5c3d525dcf96f7e77eca1ffbd61a28","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/git/trees/76d054117b5c3d525dcf96f7e77eca1ffbd61a28"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/git/commits/00e5cc127f03431a2ce81e4a3cd0160b31c08989","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/commit/00e5cc127f03431a2ce81e4a3cd0160b31c08989","node_id":"C_kwDOMGdLNtoAKDAwZTVjYzEyN2YwMzQzMWEyY2U4MWU0YTNjZDAxNjBiMzFjMDg5ODk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/commit/c0994a4f9348a04f2b122c3ebcd1911e8ad7e7d8","sha":"c0994a4f9348a04f2b122c3ebcd1911e8ad7e7d8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/commits/c0994a4f9348a04f2b122c3ebcd1911e8ad7e7d8"}],"sha":"00e5cc127f03431a2ce81e4a3cd0160b31c08989","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/commits/00e5cc127f03431a2ce81e4a3cd0160b31c08989"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/commits/c0994a4f9348a04f2b122c3ebcd1911e8ad7e7d8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-30T15:44:35Z","email":"ds.sefina@gmail.com","name":"Sefina-DS"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-30T15:44:35Z","email":"ds.sefina@gmail.com","name":"Sefina-DS"},"message":"fix(widget): theme-aware colors for room labels and sequence badges\n\nTwo related CSS adjustments made together:\n\nRoom labels (.rlabel):\n  Replaced the drop-shadow-only approach with an SVG text stroke in\n  --bg color (via paint-order:stroke fill). The stroke sits behind\n  the fill, so it frames each glyph instead of eating into it, and\n  it uses the theme background variable so contrast stays coherent\n  when the user switches themes. Fill switched from hardcoded #000\n  to var(--txt).\n\nSequence badges (.seq-badge):\n  Switched from hardcoded --accent + white text to var(--bg) fill\n  with var(--txt) stroke and text. Now the badges match the user''s\n  theme colors instead of standing out arbitrarily, and stay\n  consistent with the existing .rbadge appearance.\n\nTrade-off accepted: on pastel/inactive segment backgrounds the label\nstroke color (--bg) sits close to the segment fill, which slightly\nreduces readability compared to the active-segment case. Introducing\na dedicated max-contrast variable was considered overkill for this\nfeature.","tree":{"sha":"9b528b01a701121887b100e03557416a7ac42260","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/git/trees/9b528b01a701121887b100e03557416a7ac42260"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/git/commits/c0994a4f9348a04f2b122c3ebcd1911e8ad7e7d8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/commit/c0994a4f9348a04f2b122c3ebcd1911e8ad7e7d8","node_id":"C_kwDOMGdLNtoAKGMwOTk0YTRmOTM0OGEwNGYyYjEyMmMzZWJjZDE5MTFlOGFkN2U3ZDg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/commit/ca0bf2c259722e4dbb77585e2b905a186ee84947","sha":"ca0bf2c259722e4dbb77585e2b905a186ee84947","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/commits/ca0bf2c259722e4dbb77585e2b905a186ee84947"}],"sha":"c0994a4f9348a04f2b122c3ebcd1911e8ad7e7d8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/commits/c0994a4f9348a04f2b122c3ebcd1911e8ad7e7d8"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/commits/ca0bf2c259722e4dbb77585e2b905a186ee84947/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-30T15:14:54Z","email":"ds.sefina@gmail.com","name":"Sefina-DS"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-30T15:14:54Z","email":"ds.sefina@gmail.com","name":"Sefina-DS"},"message":"feat(widget/F10d): render sequence numbers as room badges\n\nNew .seq-badge element per room in sequenceModus.order, updated via\nthe seq-order-changed / seq-mode-changed events. Positions come from\nthe same markEls map used by updateRoomBadges, so numbers sit next\nto the existing room labels/badges.\n\nThe badge is rendered as a circle with white numeral, positioned\n20px above the room label origin (the existing .rbadge stays below\nthe name). updateSequenceBadges() is mode-aware: when\nsequenceModus.aktiv is false, all badges are cleared regardless of\nthe current .order — robust against buildOverlay rebuilds while\nthe mode is off.\n\nCSS toggle body.cleaning-sequence-off .seq-badge { display:none }\nis the hook for W3''s eye button; the underlying sequence stays\nunchanged when badges are hidden.","tree":{"sha":"6d5222f2ccd3f32ea644270b013012b50dd33cd1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/git/trees/6d5222f2ccd3f32ea644270b013012b50dd33cd1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/git/commits/ca0bf2c259722e4dbb77585e2b905a186ee84947","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/commit/ca0bf2c259722e4dbb77585e2b905a186ee84947","node_id":"C_kwDOMGdLNtoAKGNhMGJmMmMyNTk3MjJlNGRiYjc3NTg1ZTJiOTA1YTE4NmVlODQ5NDc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/commit/0c5c2bdea3c08ac9dad13a9d4e4e539edac983f9","sha":"0c5c2bdea3c08ac9dad13a9d4e4e539edac983f9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/commits/0c5c2bdea3c08ac9dad13a9d4e4e539edac983f9"}],"sha":"ca0bf2c259722e4dbb77585e2b905a186ee84947","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/commits/ca0bf2c259722e4dbb77585e2b905a186ee84947"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/commits/0c5c2bdea3c08ac9dad13a9d4e4e539edac983f9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-30T13:45:03Z","email":"ds.sefina@gmail.com","name":"Sefina-DS"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-30T13:45:03Z","email":"ds.sefina@gmail.com","name":"Sefina-DS"},"message":"feat(widget/F10b+c): tap-to-sequence on map with adapter round-trip\n\nNew module www/js/panels/sequence.js encapsulates the sequence mode.\nWhen active (sequenceModus.aktiv === true), tapping a room on the\nmap appends its id to remote.cleaning-sequence.order (or removes it\nif already present — toggle). Each tap immediately writes the new\norder to the adapter state (no optimistic UI, follows the round-trip\npattern used by raumUmschalten).\n\nExternal changes to .order are subscribed to and dispatched as a\nseq-order-changed CustomEvent for W2''s rendering to hook into.\nSequence mode itself is toggled via seq-mode-changed.\n\n.apply is intentionally NOT triggered on tap; it will fire only from\nthe start-cleaning flow in W4.\n\nRefs: F10A_LIVE_TEST_ANALYSE.md Teil F, CLEANING_SEQUENCE_ANALYSE.md.","tree":{"sha":"ee75eef9f1157cf5326a1d864d048f625429558a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/git/trees/ee75eef9f1157cf5326a1d864d048f625429558a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/git/commits/0c5c2bdea3c08ac9dad13a9d4e4e539edac983f9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/commit/0c5c2bdea3c08ac9dad13a9d4e4e539edac983f9","node_id":"C_kwDOMGdLNtoAKDBjNWMyYmRlYTNjMDhhYzlkYWQxM2E5ZDRlNGU1MzllZGFjOTgzZjk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/commit/6477b6200970731ce58f0eafa8f579840a55822b","sha":"6477b6200970731ce58f0eafa8f579840a55822b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/commits/6477b6200970731ce58f0eafa8f579840a55822b"}],"sha":"0c5c2bdea3c08ac9dad13a9d4e4e539edac983f9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/commits/0c5c2bdea3c08ac9dad13a9d4e4e539edac983f9"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/commits/6477b6200970731ce58f0eafa8f579840a55822b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-30T05:59:05Z","email":"ds.sefina@gmail.com","name":"Sefina-DS"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-30T05:59:05Z","email":"ds.sefina@gmail.com","name":"Sefina-DS"},"message":"fix(F10a): read active map id from custom-room-cleaning.active-map\n\nUpdateCleaningSequence previously derived the active map id from the\nlast path segment of status.map-object-name. Diagnostics on Gina\n(X40 Ultra, Multi-Floor) show that state references the recovery\nslot (''.../0''), not the currently active map. The actual value lives\nin remote.custom-room-cleaning.active-map as a string (''1'', ''53'', ...)\nwith a common.states label map for the UI.\n\nWithout this fix, every .apply=true would fail validation with\n''room IDs are not in the active map 0'' because no map with that id\nexists — the sequence handler was structurally unusable on real\nsetups.\n\nAlso adds a defensive /^\\d+$/ check on the read value so unexpected\ncontent (empty, whitespace, non-numeric) surfaces as a clear error\nrather than silently propagating.","tree":{"sha":"1906002ca1f2d09f56d794711a007a97f76a839f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/git/trees/1906002ca1f2d09f56d794711a007a97f76a839f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/git/commits/6477b6200970731ce58f0eafa8f579840a55822b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/commit/6477b6200970731ce58f0eafa8f579840a55822b","node_id":"C_kwDOMGdLNtoAKDY0NzdiNjIwMDk3MDczMWNlNThmMGVhZmE4ZjU3OTg0MGE1NTgyMmI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/commit/73f9a9a44d097b5a0b50ddd449dc5ad81bce5e5f","sha":"73f9a9a44d097b5a0b50ddd449dc5ad81bce5e5f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/commits/73f9a9a44d097b5a0b50ddd449dc5ad81bce5e5f"}],"sha":"6477b6200970731ce58f0eafa8f579840a55822b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/commits/6477b6200970731ce58f0eafa8f579840a55822b"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/commits/73f9a9a44d097b5a0b50ddd449dc5ad81bce5e5f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-30T05:38:19Z","email":"ds.sefina@gmail.com","name":"Sefina-DS"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-30T05:38:19Z","email":"ds.sefina@gmail.com","name":"Sefina-DS"},"message":"merge main into feature/widget-modular: bring in customCommand fix and F10a adapter skeleton\n\nIncludes:\n- 52ffc73 fix(customCommand): don''t downgrade action payloads to set_properties\n- 554a221 feat(F10a): adapter states and handler skeleton for cleaning sequence\n\nWidget work in W1-W4 depends on the new remote.cleaning-sequence.* states\nthat were added in 554a221.","tree":{"sha":"9fa781bb8be911db76de5f12d4faefb6a1365b20","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/git/trees/9fa781bb8be911db76de5f12d4faefb6a1365b20"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/git/commits/73f9a9a44d097b5a0b50ddd449dc5ad81bce5e5f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/commit/73f9a9a44d097b5a0b50ddd449dc5ad81bce5e5f","node_id":"C_kwDOMGdLNtoAKDczZjlhOWE0NGQwOTdiNWEwYjUwZGRkNDQ5ZGM1YWQ4MWJjZTVlNWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/commit/39d99ef5a71bdb6cb47514971e1fe643bec38349","sha":"39d99ef5a71bdb6cb47514971e1fe643bec38349","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/commits/39d99ef5a71bdb6cb47514971e1fe643bec38349"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/commit/554a2218e5a7ef81ed5b6c1dfd9684d19a5950d1","sha":"554a2218e5a7ef81ed5b6c1dfd9684d19a5950d1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/commits/554a2218e5a7ef81ed5b6c1dfd9684d19a5950d1"}],"sha":"73f9a9a44d097b5a0b50ddd449dc5ad81bce5e5f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/commits/73f9a9a44d097b5a0b50ddd449dc5ad81bce5e5f"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/commits/554a2218e5a7ef81ed5b6c1dfd9684d19a5950d1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-30T05:28:22Z","email":"ds.sefina@gmail.com","name":"Sefina-DS"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-30T05:28:22Z","email":"ds.sefina@gmail.com","name":"Sefina-DS"},"message":"feat(F10a): adapter states and handler skeleton for cleaning sequence\n\nAdds remote.cleaning-sequence.{order,apply,active} states and the\nstateChange handler skeleton for the cleanOrder feature (siid 6 /\naiid 2 / piid 4). Validation logic is complete: parses JSON, checks\narray shape, positive integers, uniqueness, and existence of each\nroom ID in the active map''s areaInfo (matches HA''s InvalidValueException\nsemantics).\n\nThe device send call is intentionally NOT yet active. It''s replaced\nby [F10a-BLOCKER] log.info lines that emit the fully-constructed\npayload. This is by design: the interaction between cleanOrder and\nstart-custom-clean (Design B: partial room selection with defined\norder) has not yet been live-tested. Live-test 2 will verify whether\nboth commands can be sent together and whether the device honors both\nthe room selection and the order simultaneously.\n\nOnce verified, the log.info lines will be replaced by the actual\nsendMessage call in a follow-up commit.\n\nRefs: F10A_LIVE_TEST_ANALYSE.md Teil F,\n      CLEANING_SEQUENCE_ANALYSE.md Requirements aus Live-Test.","tree":{"sha":"9fa781bb8be911db76de5f12d4faefb6a1365b20","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/git/trees/9fa781bb8be911db76de5f12d4faefb6a1365b20"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/git/commits/554a2218e5a7ef81ed5b6c1dfd9684d19a5950d1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/commit/554a2218e5a7ef81ed5b6c1dfd9684d19a5950d1","node_id":"C_kwDOMGdLNtoAKDU1NGEyMjE4ZTVhN2VmODFlZDViNmMxZGZkOTY4NGQxOWE1OTUwZDE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/commit/52ffc7333994a6443e7ab77dcf835cb0f20f55e0","sha":"52ffc7333994a6443e7ab77dcf835cb0f20f55e0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/commits/52ffc7333994a6443e7ab77dcf835cb0f20f55e0"}],"sha":"554a2218e5a7ef81ed5b6c1dfd9684d19a5950d1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/commits/554a2218e5a7ef81ed5b6c1dfd9684d19a5950d1"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/commits/52ffc7333994a6443e7ab77dcf835cb0f20f55e0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-30T05:01:40Z","email":"ds.sefina@gmail.com","name":"Sefina-DS"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-30T05:01:40Z","email":"ds.sefina@gmail.com","name":"Sefina-DS"},"message":"fix(customCommand): don''t downgrade action payloads to set_properties\n\nAction payloads sent via remote.customCommand contain both ''piid'' and\n''aiid'' keys (e.g. cleanOrder via siid 6/aiid 2/piid 4). The existing\nguard in main.js:6730 only checked for ''piid'' and downgraded any such\npayload to method ''set_properties'', which silently broke MIoT actions.\n\nAdding a negative check for ''aiid'' preserves the intended\nset_properties path (payloads that reference piid without an aiid)\nwhile letting action payloads through as method ''action''.\n\nVerified live on 2026-08-29 with Dreame X40 Ultra (r9419h, FW 4.3.9_3909):\npayload {\"siid\":6,\"aiid\":2,\"in\":[{\"piid\":4,\"value\":...}]}\nnow correctly sends with method ''action'' and returns code:0 within\n<600ms.","tree":{"sha":"1a3773efb86845374cbe3cc49db0a01900e6d99a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/git/trees/1a3773efb86845374cbe3cc49db0a01900e6d99a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/git/commits/52ffc7333994a6443e7ab77dcf835cb0f20f55e0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/commit/52ffc7333994a6443e7ab77dcf835cb0f20f55e0","node_id":"C_kwDOMGdLNtoAKDUyZmZjNzMzMzk5NGE2NDQzZTdhYjc3ZGNmODM1Y2IwZjIwZjU1ZTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/commit/13e528de8c862630451be178d0d0cc835ae8ca70","sha":"13e528de8c862630451be178d0d0cc835ae8ca70","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/commits/13e528de8c862630451be178d0d0cc835ae8ca70"}],"sha":"52ffc7333994a6443e7ab77dcf835cb0f20f55e0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/commits/52ffc7333994a6443e7ab77dcf835cb0f20f55e0"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/commits/13e528de8c862630451be178d0d0cc835ae8ca70/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-29T05:42:40Z","email":"ds.sefina@gmail.com","name":"Sefina-DS"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-29T05:42:40Z","email":"ds.sefina@gmail.com","name":"Sefina-DS"},"message":"release: v0.4.6 - Attempted fix for issue #124 layer 4 (missing pixel raster on r2253c/r2253w): map background, walls, and room fills were not rendered even though overlays and metadata came through correctly. Adds a fallback to combined_pixel_type when the base pixel raster is empty (matching Home Assistant''s renderer), and introduces permanent [MERGE-DEBUG] info-level logging (dimensions, pixel counts, wall/segment counts) so this failure mode is instantly diagnosable if it returns. Models whose base raster is already populated (e.g. r9419h) are unchanged. Thanks to luckyheiko for the pinpoint analysis.","tree":{"sha":"212301c0277c91938322fbad95e7585b1ec77311","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/git/trees/212301c0277c91938322fbad95e7585b1ec77311"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/git/commits/13e528de8c862630451be178d0d0cc835ae8ca70","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/commit/13e528de8c862630451be178d0d0cc835ae8ca70","node_id":"C_kwDOMGdLNtoAKDEzZTUyOGRlOGM4NjI2MzA0NTFiZTE3OGQwZDBjYzgzNWFlOGNhNzA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/commit/80f4e11dbf0f449dc39e72b8d2e99fa2e035c3a6","sha":"80f4e11dbf0f449dc39e72b8d2e99fa2e035c3a6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/commits/80f4e11dbf0f449dc39e72b8d2e99fa2e035c3a6"}],"sha":"13e528de8c862630451be178d0d0cc835ae8ca70","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/commits/13e528de8c862630451be178d0d0cc835ae8ca70"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/commits/80f4e11dbf0f449dc39e72b8d2e99fa2e035c3a6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-28T19:59:52Z","email":"ds.sefina@gmail.com","name":"Sefina-DS"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-28T19:59:52Z","email":"ds.sefina@gmail.com","name":"Sefina-DS"},"message":"release: v0.4.5 - Fix for issue #124 (Layer 3): map rendering could crash on the frontend when the device reported detected carpets with an invalid polygon field (null or malformed). Adds a filter in lib/mapMerge.js so invalid carpets never reach the frontend, a defensive guard in the carpet drawing routine in www/js/karte/merger.js, and a generic try/catch around overlay drawing so a single bad overlay never breaks the whole map rendering. The unreferenced legacy widget page www/legacy.html, which carried the same bug, is removed. Combined with 0.4.3 (comma-truncation) and 0.4.4 (AES decryption), this closes the full end-to-end map path for r2253c/r2253w. Thanks to luckyheiko for identifying the root cause and proposing the fix approach.","tree":{"sha":"3cccb7ace251b3f4ad6e12945dd81f2433ad447a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/git/trees/3cccb7ace251b3f4ad6e12945dd81f2433ad447a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/git/commits/80f4e11dbf0f449dc39e72b8d2e99fa2e035c3a6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/commit/80f4e11dbf0f449dc39e72b8d2e99fa2e035c3a6","node_id":"C_kwDOMGdLNtoAKDgwZjRlMTFkYmYwZjQ0OWRjMzllNzJiOGQyZTk5ZmEyZTAzNWMzYTY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/commit/e69e80ec4327e424c1410497691a716d5923d386","sha":"e69e80ec4327e424c1410497691a716d5923d386","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/commits/e69e80ec4327e424c1410497691a716d5923d386"}],"sha":"80f4e11dbf0f449dc39e72b8d2e99fa2e035c3a6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/commits/80f4e11dbf0f449dc39e72b8d2e99fa2e035c3a6"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/commits/e69e80ec4327e424c1410497691a716d5923d386/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-28T19:59:23Z","email":"ds.sefina@gmail.com","name":"Sefina-DS"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-28T19:59:23Z","email":"ds.sefina@gmail.com","name":"Sefina-DS"},"message":"fix(map): guard renderer against invalid detected-carpet polygons (issue #124 layer 3)\n\nAfter the 0.4.3/0.4.4 fixes the decrypted map now reaches the frontend, but\nr2253c/r2253w maps whose detected carpets come from the carpet_info branch\ncarry polygon:null (lib/haDecode.js). buildCarpetData() in\nwww/js/karte/merger.js then calls c.polygon.filter(...) unguarded, throws a\nTypeError inside decode(), and the whole map fails to render with a \"Fehler:\"\nbox instead.\n\nThree parts, one theme (robustness against malformed overlay data):\n- lib/mapMerge.js: filter detected_carpets to entries with a valid polygon\n  (Array, even length, >= 3 points) before they enter the wire format;\n  log.debug each dropped carpet.\n- www/js/karte/merger.js: defensive guard in the detected-carpet loop plus a\n  try/catch around each overlay-draw block so one bad overlay can never break\n  the whole map rendering.\n- www/legacy.html: removed. It carried the same bug, is no longer referenced\n  anywhere at runtime (www/index.html is the active widget) and had not been\n  touched since the folder-structure commit.\n\ntest/mapMerge.test.js: covers null / odd-length / too-short polygons -> only\nthe valid carpet passes through, no crash.\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01MHKpeWgfkghf716bCbYLMJ","tree":{"sha":"164bc75021de5145d782b30a921ef11df2b7de33","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/git/trees/164bc75021de5145d782b30a921ef11df2b7de33"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/git/commits/e69e80ec4327e424c1410497691a716d5923d386","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/commit/e69e80ec4327e424c1410497691a716d5923d386","node_id":"C_kwDOMGdLNtoAKGU2OWU4MGVjNDMyN2U0MjRjMTQxMDQ5NzY5MWE3MTZkNTkyM2QzODY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/commit/5474b6e78095527959e4e3795f25e6d1211a54fd","sha":"5474b6e78095527959e4e3795f25e6d1211a54fd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/commits/5474b6e78095527959e4e3795f25e6d1211a54fd"}],"sha":"e69e80ec4327e424c1410497691a716d5923d386","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/commits/e69e80ec4327e424c1410497691a716d5923d386"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/commits/5474b6e78095527959e4e3795f25e6d1211a54fd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-28T15:14:24Z","email":"ds.sefina@gmail.com","name":"Sefina-DS"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-28T15:14:24Z","email":"ds.sefina@gmail.com","name":"Sefina-DS"},"message":"release: v0.4.4 - Fix for issue #124 (Layer 2): map payload for r2253c, r2253w and similar newer Dreame models is AES-256-CBC encrypted; the adapter now derives the AES key from the object_name comma suffix (SHA256, first 32 hex chars as UTF-8), uses a model-specific IV, and decrypts the payload before zlib inflation. Combined with the 0.4.3 comma-truncation fix, this closes the full end-to-end map download path for r2253 models. Also fixes a long-standing bug in lib/dreame.js where the persistent MAP_LIST path used an empty IV instead of the model-specific one. Models without a comma suffix in the object_name (e.g. r9419h/L40s) are unchanged. Thanks to luckyheiko and ralfheitz for the diagnostic logs.","tree":{"sha":"c7bcc351af70b1988af646d941a2eb2bb0d4fb3e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/git/trees/c7bcc351af70b1988af646d941a2eb2bb0d4fb3e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/git/commits/5474b6e78095527959e4e3795f25e6d1211a54fd","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/commit/5474b6e78095527959e4e3795f25e6d1211a54fd","node_id":"C_kwDOMGdLNtoAKDU0NzRiNmU3ODA5NTUyNzk1OWU0ZTM3OTVmMjVlNmQxMjExYTU0ZmQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/commit/5cd6b90ec412f71d3ea229d083cc4df4786466cd","sha":"5cd6b90ec412f71d3ea229d083cc4df4786466cd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/commits/5cd6b90ec412f71d3ea229d083cc4df4786466cd"}],"sha":"5474b6e78095527959e4e3795f25e6d1211a54fd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/commits/5474b6e78095527959e4e3795f25e6d1211a54fd"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/commits/5cd6b90ec412f71d3ea229d083cc4df4786466cd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-28T15:13:53Z","email":"ds.sefina@gmail.com","name":"Sefina-DS"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-28T15:13:53Z","email":"ds.sefina@gmail.com","name":"Sefina-DS"},"message":"fix(map): decrypt AES-256-CBC map payload for r2253c/r2253w (issue #124 layer 2)\n\nAdds decryptMapPayload/getIvForModel to lib/dreame.js and wires them into the\nfresh force-I map path in mapController.js: the object_name comma suffix (kept\naround before the 0.4.3 truncation, not discarded) is the AES key material,\nhashed with SHA-256 and combined with a model-specific IV. Also fixes the\nexisting MAP_LIST/thumbnail decrypt path in lib/dreame.js, which used an empty\nIV instead of the model-specific one.\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01StVkDNPgNyaeH7tbtfKF4j","tree":{"sha":"67524c74cf7f8b95afb54259100ea14050902a69","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/git/trees/67524c74cf7f8b95afb54259100ea14050902a69"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/git/commits/5cd6b90ec412f71d3ea229d083cc4df4786466cd","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/commit/5cd6b90ec412f71d3ea229d083cc4df4786466cd","node_id":"C_kwDOMGdLNtoAKDVjZDZiOTBlYzQxMmY3MWQzZWEyMjlkMDgzY2M0ZGY0Nzg2NDY2Y2Q","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/commit/c3ba69e675ee720cde97f017e84cd21c346eb1f9","sha":"c3ba69e675ee720cde97f017e84cd21c346eb1f9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/commits/c3ba69e675ee720cde97f017e84cd21c346eb1f9"}],"sha":"5cd6b90ec412f71d3ea229d083cc4df4786466cd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/commits/5cd6b90ec412f71d3ea229d083cc4df4786466cd"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/commits/c3ba69e675ee720cde97f017e84cd21c346eb1f9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-28T05:12:24Z","email":"ds.sefina@gmail.com","name":"Sefina-DS"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-28T05:12:24Z","email":"ds.sefina@gmail.com","name":"Sefina-DS"},"message":"release: v0.4.3 - Fix for issue #124 (HTTP 404 on map download for r2253c, r2253w and similar newer Dreame models where the Dreame backend returns an object_name with a comma suffix that the OSS storage does not resolve): the adapter now transparently retries with the object_name truncated at the first comma. Models without a comma in the object_name (e.g. r9419h/L40s) are unchanged. Diagnostic [MAP-DIAG] logging from 0.4.2 remains but only fires when the fallback also fails; new [MAP-DIAG-2] captures the retry outcome for future analysis.","tree":{"sha":"9b2c81f585950b065232982a8d2f1903f7942a42","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/git/trees/9b2c81f585950b065232982a8d2f1903f7942a42"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/git/commits/c3ba69e675ee720cde97f017e84cd21c346eb1f9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/commit/c3ba69e675ee720cde97f017e84cd21c346eb1f9","node_id":"C_kwDOMGdLNtoAKGMzYmE2OWU2NzVlZTcyMGNkZTk3ZjAxN2U4NGNkMjFjMzQ2ZWIxZjk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/commit/0a1515731273885709751ae8a70b2a3625758876","sha":"0a1515731273885709751ae8a70b2a3625758876","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/commits/0a1515731273885709751ae8a70b2a3625758876"}],"sha":"c3ba69e675ee720cde97f017e84cd21c346eb1f9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/commits/c3ba69e675ee720cde97f017e84cd21c346eb1f9"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/commits/0a1515731273885709751ae8a70b2a3625758876/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-28T05:11:55Z","email":"ds.sefina@gmail.com","name":"Sefina-DS"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-28T05:11:55Z","email":"ds.sefina@gmail.com","name":"Sefina-DS"},"message":"fix(map): retry fresh-map download with truncated object_name on 404 (issue #124)\n\nr2253c/r2253w and similar newer models return an object_name with a\ncomma suffix (e.g. \"<mapId>,<suffix>\") that the OSS storage does not\nresolve, causing a 404. On such a 404 the adapter now retries once\nwith the object_name truncated at the first comma. Models without a\ncomma are unaffected. The 0.4.2 [MAP-DIAG] warn block still fires if\nthe retry also fails; new [MAP-DIAG-2] logs the retry outcome.","tree":{"sha":"651d4514638869333e4e7df41336543ea7198a85","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/git/trees/651d4514638869333e4e7df41336543ea7198a85"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/git/commits/0a1515731273885709751ae8a70b2a3625758876","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/commit/0a1515731273885709751ae8a70b2a3625758876","node_id":"C_kwDOMGdLNtoAKDBhMTUxNTczMTI3Mzg4NTcwOTc1MWFlOGE3MGIyYTM2MjU3NTg4NzY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/commit/bbc2de4b587e7618c7a8b6859bec43818e65a3f8","sha":"bbc2de4b587e7618c7a8b6859bec43818e65a3f8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/commits/bbc2de4b587e7618c7a8b6859bec43818e65a3f8"}],"sha":"0a1515731273885709751ae8a70b2a3625758876","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/commits/0a1515731273885709751ae8a70b2a3625758876"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/commits/bbc2de4b587e7618c7a8b6859bec43818e65a3f8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-27T18:51:22Z","email":"ds.sefina@gmail.com","name":"Sefina-DS"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-27T18:51:22Z","email":"ds.sefina@gmail.com","name":"Sefina-DS"},"message":"release: v0.4.2 - Diagnostic release for issue #124 (HTTP 404 on r2253c/L20 Ultra map download): adds temporary [MAP-DIAG] logging on HTTP errors during fresh map downloads (model, did, object_name, download_url, HTTP status, timing, content-type, response body head) to distinguish race, region and object-name-format hypotheses. No functional changes; fallback to persistent MAP_LIST map unchanged. Diagnostic will be reverted in 0.4.3 together with the actual fix.","tree":{"sha":"2236c47bd6b6d7799ef9996db815e2463d914fa0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/git/trees/2236c47bd6b6d7799ef9996db815e2463d914fa0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/git/commits/bbc2de4b587e7618c7a8b6859bec43818e65a3f8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/commit/bbc2de4b587e7618c7a8b6859bec43818e65a3f8","node_id":"C_kwDOMGdLNtoAKGJiYzJkZTRiNTg3ZTc2MThjN2E4YjY4NTliZWM0MzgxOGU2NWEzZjg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/commit/ce98ebee7ac4422ca1a980682f22310bafce78f9","sha":"ce98ebee7ac4422ca1a980682f22310bafce78f9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/commits/ce98ebee7ac4422ca1a980682f22310bafce78f9"}],"sha":"bbc2de4b587e7618c7a8b6859bec43818e65a3f8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TA2k/ioBroker.dreame/commits/bbc2de4b587e7618c7a8b6859bec43818e65a3f8"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"ht