arred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ainmutaqorrobin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ainmutaqorrobin","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ainmutaqorrobin/ainmutaqorrobin/commits/8cc72a609eac0f80c6fb70eff1ff5b2a41984975/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-19T01:22:49Z","email":"ainmutaqorrobin@gmail.com","name":"ainmutaqorrobin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-19T01:22:49Z","email":"ainmutaqorrobin@gmail.com","name":"ainmutaqorrobin"},"message":"docs(readme): refresh profile with current role, stack, and projects\n\nRewrites the About Me section to reflect current work at Studio20 rather\nthan the outdated fresh-graduate framing, and replaces the 2024-era\nlearning projects with the last several months of work: bunship,\nbook-review-platform, appctl, ai-policy-helper, TicketingApp, and the\nDevOps capstone.\n\nAdds technologies now used across those repos but previously missing\n(Python, FastAPI, Bash, Bun, Redis/BullMQ, Qdrant, Drizzle, Tailwind,\nExpo, Turborepo, Nginx, GitHub Actions, AWS, Cloudflare) and drops ones\nno longer in active use. Restructures the stack table from eight columns\nto one row per category so it stays compact and does not overflow on\nnarrow screens. Adds website and X links to the contact section.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"45397d1c8558235842204ba2569e7063f4369d7f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ainmutaqorrobin/ainmutaqorrobin/git/trees/45397d1c8558235842204ba2569e7063f4369d7f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ainmutaqorrobin/ainmutaqorrobin/git/commits/8cc72a609eac0f80c6fb70eff1ff5b2a41984975","verification":{"payload":"tree 45397d1c8558235842204ba2569e7063f4369d7f\nparent 229d4d6eaf8f1b395e7fad8c5d0d019a3eaf4f44\nauthor ainmutaqorrobin <ainmutaqorrobin@gmail.com> 1784424169 +0800\ncommitter ainmutaqorrobin <ainmutaqorrobin@gmail.com> 1784424169 +0800\n\ndocs(readme): refresh profile with current role, stack, and projects\n\nRewrites the About Me section to reflect current work at Studio20 rather\nthan the outdated fresh-graduate framing, and replaces the 2024-era\nlearning projects with the last several months of work: bunship,\nbook-review-platform, appctl, ai-policy-helper, TicketingApp, and the\nDevOps capstone.\n\nAdds technologies now used across those repos but previously missing\n(Python, FastAPI, Bash, Bun, Redis/BullMQ, Qdrant, Drizzle, Tailwind,\nExpo, Turborepo, Nginx, GitHub Actions, AWS, Cloudflare) and drops ones\nno longer in active use. Restructures the stack table from eight columns\nto one row per category so it stays compact and does not overflow on\nnarrow screens. Adds website and X links to the contact section.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgINwBX/eVdzVvlWapBkomPVzqpY\nB6oo9Gmc+UPU0iIP8AAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQBR5phm3guAkOk6ElJ4QmvrSl6lNpu3CZrf6yu1MXzaVIRuqEdL3seei908E9Klxsy\nlmxjkTBvfBVlkeNHaDQAo=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-19T01:23:33Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/102634689?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ainmutaqorrobin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ainmutaqorrobin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ainmutaqorrobin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ainmutaqorrobin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ainmutaqorrobin","id":102634689,"login":"ainmutaqorrobin","node_id":"U_kgDOBh4UwQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ainmutaqorrobin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ainmutaqorrobin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ainmutaqo