 there would be no\nwhitespace between the first two clauses of the \"Start Now\" section''s\nsubtitle. This does not matter on larger screens, because there is a\n`<br>` element that is included between them\n\nThis commit fixes this by ensuring that there is always a space after\nthe first clause, regardless of whether the `<br>` element is displayed\nor not.\n\n**Before the fix:**\n![Web-fragments webpage - before][1]\n\n**After the fix:**\n![Weg-fragments webpage - after][2]\n\n[1]: https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/40b55be4-2497-4053-9306-cd4edbd81266\n[2]: https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/5000d358-3014-4271-ad00-0267c1081c9d","tree":{"sha":"8ab2340eefc16ea3a0ef7fd58178de26db5075be","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/web-fragments/web-fragments/git/trees/8ab2340eefc16ea3a0ef7fd58178de26db5075be"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/web-fragments/web-fragments/git/commits/3cf69bc5ae8da98e01a36afba96e78e43979f16e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/216296?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IgorMinar/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IgorMinar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IgorMinar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IgorMinar/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/IgorMinar","id":216296,"login":"IgorMinar","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxNjI5Ng==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IgorMinar/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IgorMinar/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IgorMinar/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IgorMinar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IgorMinar/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/IgorMinar","user_view_type"