6296?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IgorMinar/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IgorMinar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IgorMinar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IgorMinar/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/IgorMinar","id":216296,"login":"IgorMinar","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxNjI5Ng==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IgorMinar/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IgorMinar/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IgorMinar/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IgorMinar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IgorMinar/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/IgorMinar","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/web-fragments/web-fragments/commits/6b1af2975dcd8cd08af345050baf2803b2362a0d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-08-22T03:54:07Z","email":"iminar@cloudflare.com","name":"Igor Minar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-08-29T03:27:42Z","email":"i@igor.dev","name":"Igor Minar"},"message":"feat(gateway): add FragmentConfig#iframeHeaders support for configuring iframe headers\n\nThe fragment config can now optionally include `iframeHeaders` key that can contain a `Record<string, string>` of header names and their values.\n\nThis feature is useful to configure response headers for requests that come from initialization of the reframed iframe which powers the configured Web Fragment.\n\nFor example, you could use this header to configure CSP policy for the iframe, or override any of the default headers set by the Web Fragments gateway.\n\nExample usage:\n\n```js\nfragmentGateway.registerFragment({\n\tfragmentId: ''my-fragment'',\n  ...\n  iframeHeaders: {\n\t\t''Some-Header'': ''my value'',\n\t\t''another-header'': ''my other value'',\n\t},\n});\n```","tree":{"sha":"b4b3b0f9525020f52b64e060e351d51e6acda5ab","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/web-fragments/web-fragments/git/trees/b4b3b0f9525020f52b64e060e351d51e6acda5ab"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/web-fragments/web-fragments/git/commits/6b1af2975dcd8cd08af345050baf2803b2362a0d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/216296?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IgorMinar/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IgorMinar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IgorMinar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IgorMinar/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/IgorMinar","id":216296,"login":"IgorMinar","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxNjI5Ng==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IgorMinar/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IgorMinar/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IgorMinar/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IgorMinar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IgorMinar/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/IgorMinar","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/web-fragments/web-fragments/commit/6b1af2975dcd8cd08af345050baf2803b2362a0d","node_id":"C_kwDOMKPkZtoAKDZiMWFmMjk3NWRjZDhjZDA4YWYzNDUwNTBiYWYyODAzYjIzNjJhMGQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/web-fragments/web-fragments/commit/21cb50f339c997b6759c646a799db2b184fa73eb","sha":"21cb50f339c997b6759c646a799db2b184fa73eb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/web-fragments/web-fragments/commits/21cb50f339c997b6759c646a799db2b184fa73eb"}],"sha":"6b1af2975dcd8cd08af345050baf2803b2362a0d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/web-fragments/web-fragments/commits/6b1af2975dcd8cd08af345050baf2803b2362a0d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/216296?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IgorMinar/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IgorMinar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IgorMinar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IgorMinar/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/IgorMinar","id":216296,"login":"IgorMinar","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxNjI5Ng==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IgorMinar/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IgorMinar/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IgorMinar/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IgorMinar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IgorMinar/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/IgorMinar","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/web-fragments/web-fragments/commits/21cb50f339c997b6759c646a799db2b184fa73eb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-07-30T16:33:11Z","email":"iminar@cloudflare.com","name":"Igor Minar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-08-29T03:27:42Z","email":"i@igor.dev","name":"Igor Minar"},"message":"fix: throw WebFragmentError when we risk infinite iframe recursion during reframe init\n\nIf the fragment gateway was not properly configured (e.g. the routePaths\ndon''t contain the main navigable url that starts a fragment), reframed\ncreates an iframe which when loaded by the browser loads the original\nhost html rather than the minimal reframed init html, which then causes\na new nested fragment to be created which then repeats the process,\nresulting in an infinite recursion.\n\nThis turns out to be a rather common user error, so to make it easier to\ndiagnose and fix, we now detect it and throw an error.","tree":{"sha":"cfe3111d4ca32a061603b50ae512f9d1f5e63596","url":"https://api.githu