pos/urth-inc/metatell-plugins/commits/7c877bb47465f3bd2ab09cea079ccd92fdc67c26"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/urth-inc/metatell-plugins/commit/1efc09d0fab8c5263eab20f14e71c9793a661bc0","sha":"1efc09d0fab8c5263eab20f14e71c9793a661bc0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/urth-inc/metatell-plugins/commits/1efc09d0fab8c5263eab20f14e71c9793a661bc0"}],"sha":"bddd53bddb9d7e634a00d180e0e0d430c95a54e8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/urth-inc/metatell-plugins/commits/bddd53bddb9d7e634a00d180e0e0d430c95a54e8"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5345124?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kira924age/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kira924age/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kira924age/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kira924age/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kira924age","id":5345124,"login":"kira924age","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzNDUxMjQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kira924age/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kira924age/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kira924age/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kira924age/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kira924age/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kira924age","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/urth-inc/metatell-plugins/commits/1efc09d0fab8c5263eab20f14e71c9793a661bc0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-10T10:41:35Z","email":"kira924age@gmail.com","name":"AkiraKunishige"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-10T10:41:35Z","email":"kira924age@gmail.com","name":"AkiraKunishige"},"message":"Upgrade dependencies to latest across all templates\n\nBrings every template up to the current release of its dependencies,\nwhich clears the outstanding npm audit findings: 21 vulnerabilities\nacross the repo down to 0.\n\nThe driver was adm-zip <0.6.0 (GHSA-xcpc-8h2w-3j85, high: a crafted ZIP\ntriggers a 4GB allocation), which every template pulled in through\nscripts/archive_dist.js. CustomExitScreen carried a further 10, having\npinned its dependencies exactly and drifted behind.\n\nNotable major bumps: vite 6 -> 8, typescript 5 -> 7, vitest 3 -> 4,\n@testing-library/react 11 -> 16, @vitejs/plugin-react 5 -> 6,\n@module-federation/vite 1.9 -> 1.20, biome 2.3 -> 2.5, jsdom 28 -> 30,\nuuid 13 -> 14, and in CustomTutorial react-joyride 2 -> 3 plus\n@tsparticles 3 -> 4.\n\nreact, react-dom and their @types are deliberately held at 18. They are\ndeclared as Module Federation singletons and shared with the metatell\nhost, so bumping them here without knowing the host''s version would\nbreak every plugin at runtime. react-toastify is held for the same\nreason (CustomMegaphoneButton shares it).\n\nThree breaking changes needed code:\n\n- TypeScript 7 removed the `baseUrl` option, so it is dropped from all\n  ten tsconfig.json files. Nothing used `paths`, so it was inert.\n- react-joyride 3 dropped its default export and restructured props:\n  `options` moved out of `styles`, `hideCloseButton`/`hideBackButton`/\n  `styles.buttonNext` collapse into `options.buttons: []`,\n  `disableOverlay` -> `options.hideOverlay`, `disableOverlayClose` ->\n  `options.overlayClickAction: false`, `disableCloseOnEsc` ->\n  `options.dismissKeyAction: false`, `floaterProps` ->\n  `floatingOptions`.\n- @tsparticles/react 4 replaced `initParticlesEngine` with a\n  `ParticlesProvider` + `useParticlesProvider` pair, so ParticleEffect\n  now renders through the provider instead of an effect-driven flag.\n\nVerified per template: build, tests and lint. CustomTutorial was also\nchecked in a browser, since neither library migration is covered by\ntests — the tour tooltip keeps its dark styling with no back/close/next\nbuttons and no overlay, and the confetti canvas renders.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"31bae48fe9c70dea4d5d9ca430c90790354c50b7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/urth-inc/metatell-plugins/git/trees/31bae48fe9c70dea4d5d9ca430c90790354c50b7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/urth-inc/metatell-plugins/git/commits/1efc09d0fab8c5263eab20f14e71c9793a661bc0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5345124?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kira924age/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kira924age/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kira924age/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kira924age/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kira924age","id":5345124,"login":"kira924age","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzNDUxMjQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kira924age/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kira924age/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kira924age/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kira924age/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kira924age/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kira924age","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/urth-inc/metatell-plugins/commit/1efc09d0fab8c5263eab20f14e71c9793a661bc0","node_id":"C_kwDOMKyGgtoAKDFlZmMwOWQwZmFiOGM1MjYzZWFiMjBmMTRlNzFjOTc5M2E2NjFiYzA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/urth-inc/metatell-plugins/commit/7c877bb47465f3bd2ab09cea079ccd92fdc67c26","sha":"7c877bb47465f3bd2ab09cea079ccd92fdc67c26","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/urth-inc/metatell-plugins/commits/7c877bb47465f3bd2ab09cea079ccd92fdc67c26"}],"sha":"1efc09d0fab8c5263eab20f14e71c9793a661bc0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/urth